# purpose: transfer precedence in the combinations the other m4 scenarios leave out.
# exercises: both accounts frozen AND different currencies (frozen source wins); closed source vs
#            unknown destination (unknown wins); frozen destination with insufficient source (frozen
#            wins); transfer tags across many rejections; transfer to a just-closed account.
OPEN a1 USD
OPEN a2 EUR
OPEN a3 USD
OPEN a4 USD
DEPOSIT a1 10
DEPOSIT a2 10
DEPOSIT a3 10
FREEZE a1
FREEZE a2
TRANSFER a1 a2 5
TRANSFER a2 a1 5
TRANSFER a1 a2 -5
UNFREEZE a1
TRANSFER a1 a2 5
TRANSFER a1 a2 500
TRANSFER a1 a3 500
TRANSFER a3 a2 5
TRANSFER a1 a4 10
TRANSFER a1 a4 0.01
TRANSFER a4 a1 10
CLOSE a4
TRANSFER a4 nobody 1
TRANSFER a1 a4 1
TRANSFER a4 a1 1
TRANSFER a3 a1 10
TRANSFER a3 a1 0.01
TRANSFER a1 a3 20
UNFREEZE a2
TRANSFER a2 a1 1
TRANSFER a2 a2 1
BALANCE a1
BALANCE a2
BALANCE a3
BALANCE a4
